### Data‑flow narrative (Mermaid‑style)

graph TD
    WebClient -->|HTTP POST /entity| ApiGateway
    ApiGateway -->|REST call| HCEController
    HCEController -->|invoke| ConsistencyFacade
    ConsistencyFacade -->|select| ConsistencyStrategy
    ConsistencyStrategy -->|publish| KafkaProducer
    KafkaProducer -->|topic=entity-events| KafkaBroker
